
"smart_sources:Flora - Memory Books/053 - Wedding Night Vigil.md": {"path":"Flora - Memory Books/053 - Wedding Night Vigil.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"14pv8q4","at":1777331817801},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776821025176,"size":3328,"at":1777331817824,"hash":"14pv8q4"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,26],"#053 - Wedding Night Vigil":[28,34],"#053 - Wedding Night Vigil#{1}":[30,34]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Claymore Manor","Triadic marriage","Blood-sister bond","Hamilton vigil","Pearl-handled knife","Rosemary cake","Karambit","Valheim prison","Eleven day deadline","Great Hall"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**AI Search Summary:**  \nThis entry details the immediate post-wedding events for Ryan, Charlotte, and Florence at Claymore Manor. It includes two key scenes: 1) The \"Hamilton Blood Vigil,\" a ritual binding Estra Hamilton as a blood-sister to the marriage for protection from Loren. 2) The wedding night's intimate power dynamic, where Charlotte takes dominant command. Select for queries about the wedding's aftermath, the ritual's purpose, marital dynamics, or character interactions involving Ryan, his wives, Estra, or the threat from Loren."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/053 - Wedding Night Vigil.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1mcld9f","at":1777331817801},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/053 - Wedding Night Vigil.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,26],"size":958,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
